#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:213
msgid ""
"_The voice of Gork booms out across the battlefield driving back his foes "
"with a rancid gale force yell._"
msgstr ""
"_La voix de Gork tonne sur le champ de bataille et repousse ses ennemis d’un "
"cri surpuissant._"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/goblins.adoc:226
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:178
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:217
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast on any unengaged enemy unit within range regardless "
"of whether the Shaman can see it or not. The spell cannot be cast on a unit "
"engaged in combat."
msgstr ""
"Ce sort peut être lancé sur une unité ennemie à portée du Chaman, qu’il "
"puisse la voir ou non, mais pas sur une unité engagée au combat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/goblins.adoc:256
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:232
msgid ""
"_The shaman summons the power of the mighty Waaagh! to invigorate the "
"greenskins._"
msgstr ""
"_Le chaman invoque la puissance de la grande Waaagh ! pour encourager les "
"peaux vertes._"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/goblins.adoc:266
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:242
msgid ""
"The spell lasts for the duration of the following Combat phase.  Every stand "
"in the unit, including characters that have joined the unit, adds +1 to its "
"Attacks value."
msgstr ""
"Le sort dure toute la prochaine phase de combat.  Chaque socle de l’unité, y "
"compris les socles de Personnages qui l’ont rejointe, ajoute +1 à sa valeur "
"d’Attaques."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/norse.adoc:209
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:196
msgid ""
"Draw an imaginary line 30cm long from the Shaman’s stand in any direction "
"you wish. The line will pass through any intervening units but not beyond "
"terrain that would normally stop a missile shot, e.g. over the crest of a "
"hill, more than 2cm of woodland, and so forth."
msgstr ""
"Tracez une ligne imaginaire de 30cm de long partant du socle du Chaman vers "
"la direction de votre choix. Cette ligne traverse les unités, mais s’arrête "
"contre les décors qui bloquent normalement les tirs, comme les collines, "
"plus de 2 cm de forêt, etc."

